VTC role sources: third-party notice
====================================

Parts of the role prompts under roles/ and of the lens, stack and domain packs under skills/ are
forked from msitarzewski/agency-agents (https://github.com/msitarzewski/agency-agents), read at
commit f99f6aa910a442b0197b768ce0ea7751e35e2060 (2026-10-07). Each forked role names its upstream
files in a "# Forked from" comment at the top of its role.yaml; each forked skill names them in a
"Sources" line.

VTC rewrote every forked file to its role contract (spec section 5.1): persona, memory, emoji and
"vibe" sections, code samples, vanity metrics, references to other agents, scripts and paths, and
the unsafe instructions listed in the role catalogue (section 5.5) were removed; rules, decision
tables and checklists were kept, reworded and merged. The compiled plugins carry this notice.

